[{"id":1078582740503707648,"date":1545989139000,"rawContent":"@whitespeaking Actually, not really, after how she defended her father publicly when he was outed in #MeToo.","userId":635638927,"media":null,"username":"iPriyanka_S","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":35,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1079100116617842689,"date":1546112491000,"rawContent":"Wow! #RaniMukerji is like the biggest ever disappoinment on actresses roundtable! On #MeToo, she says, \"Women should change before asking other people to change. They need to be strong enough to end things then and there.\" So pissed. Deepika &amp; Anushka give her befitting replies.","userId":635638927,"media":null,"username":"iPriyanka_S","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":36,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1079253398384447488,"date":1546149036000,"rawContent":"@awryaditi So true! She waits for others to complete, then keeps her point. And she sounds so evolved. She had me on her views on #MeToo.","userId":635638927,"media":null,"username":"iPriyanka_S","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":37,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1082925629908111360,"date":1547024564000,"rawContent":"\"The judge noted that the allegation raised by the complainant might have been inspired by her \"unrequited and un-reciprocated love\" for Nath.\"\n\nNo. We would never believe our women, come what may. It's still all about men. Only about them. #MeToo","userId":635638927,"media":null,"username":"iPriyanka_S","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":38,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1083627703461400578,"date":1547191951000,"rawContent":"The Mumbai Mirror blind. Hoping the ambiguity gives way to clarity and what needs to come out, is out for everyone to see. #MeToo","userId":635638927,"media":null,"username":"iPriyanka_S","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":39,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1084836682657079296,"date":1547480195000,"rawContent":"\"All I want to say is that this too shall pass and I can imagine how demeaning it might be to even stand up for yourself in a situation such as this,\" Sharman Joshi tells PTI. \n\nCan he imagine how the woman felt when she was violated, repeatedly? #MeToo","userId":635638927,"media":null,"username":"iPriyanka_S","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":40,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1090638094171287552,"date":1548863359000,"rawContent":"\"I have known this man for a long time,\" DOES NOT mean he can't assault or harass a woman. A man, who is good to you, is not necessarily good to other women. Period. #MeToo","userId":635638927,"media":null,"username":"iPriyanka_S","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":41,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1093222703916556288,"date":1549479578000,"rawContent":"Celebrities citing \"wrong platform\" while refusing to answer anything on #MeToo is the laziest way of escaping a reaction. As if you oblige media with special \"MeToo addressal\" press meets.","userId":635638927,"media":null,"username":"iPriyanka_S","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":42,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1098240149316648966,"date":1550675830000,"rawContent":"Atul Agnihotri could have done with a few hashtags to complete the picture. #MeToo #MeTooIndia","userId":635638927,"media":null,"username":"iPriyanka_S","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":43,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1101324738075475969,"date":1551411253000,"rawContent":"That's what we do with an accused in India. #metoo #MeTooIndia","userId":635638927,"media":null,"username":"iPriyanka_S","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":44,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1101766716844068864,"date":1551516629000,"rawContent":"@Openthemag @mjakbar Do you have even an iota of shame? @mjakbar has been accused of SEXUALLY ABUSING several women. You claim to be a source of news for affairs for Modern India. Are you yourself not up to date with the news?? #MeToo #MeTooIndia","userId":635638927,"media":null,"username":"iPriyanka_S","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":45,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1102886598268592128,"date":1551783630000,"rawContent":"Today's irony.\n\n#SubhashGhai, accused of sexual harassment by multiple women, is holding a panel discussion on the evolving role of women in the Hindi film industry.   Actor @AahanaKumra is one of the guests. She happens to be terribly uninformed, I guess. #MeToo #MeTooIndia","userId":635638927,"media":null,"username":"iPriyanka_S","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":46,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1103238919485878272,"date":1551867630000,"rawContent":"Please tell me why does the story of a sexual harassment allegation have a hyper-sexualised image of the woman? Titillating or reporting an important story? @Koimoi #MeToo #MeTooIndia","userId":635638927,"media":null,"username":"iPriyanka_S","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":47,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1104326815630409729,"date":1552127004000,"rawContent":"This is a woman, who has gone all out against her alleged abuser. She has been one of the strongest forces behind #MeToo movement in Bollywood and this is is the price she is paying. #MeTooIndia","userId":635638927,"media":null,"username":"iPriyanka_S","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":48,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1111219482687623169,"date":1553770344000,"rawContent":"Rohini, let's not school women on how to pursue their agency but aim for an environment, which doesn't intimidate them. #MeToo #metooindia","userId":635638927,"media":null,"username":"iPriyanka_S","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":49,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1116432742009450497,"date":1555013282000,"rawContent":"\"[Women are] not seen as the stereotypical abuser. So, a lot of times, victims have trouble identifying what happened to them as being abuse,\" Stemple said. #Metoo","userId":635638927,"media":null,"username":"iPriyanka_S","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMat