rawContent":"Even as it feels good to read this, I want to ask these very distributors that what happened to their morality when it came to a bigger film like #DeDePyaarDe? #MeToo","userId":635638927,"media":null,"username":"iPriyanka_S","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":54,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1120964276095725569,"date":1556093684000,"rawContent":"Sajid shared, \u201cI am under suspension and not working for the last six months. I want to respectfully finish it and then consider work.\u201d To all those, who screamed, \"You want to destroy careers of men!!\" this director is already back to work. :) #metoo","userId":635638927,"media":null,"username":"iPriyanka_S","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":55,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1126380427193737217,"date":1557384995000,"rawContent":"@saminaUFshaikh Samina, #MeToo is gender neutral. A lot of men around the globe have opened up about harassment under Me Too. The Twitter account of Me Too India has kept up the fight against harassment of men. So, what does this Men Too aim to do makes no sense.","userId":635638927,"media":null,"username":"iPriyanka_S","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":56,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1126381370773606406,"date":1557385220000,"rawContent":"@saminaUFshaikh #metoo encompasses all genders because it started as a movement to talk about harassment. Just because more women came out with their stories than men, they felt threatened because it's very difficult for men to see women claiming their space.","userId":635638927,"media":null,"username":"iPriyanka_S","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":57,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0}]